<view class="page privacy-page">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view class="page-kicker">测试版 · 关系说明书</view>
    <view class="page-title">隐私说明</view>
    <view class="page-desc">填写中的草稿保存在当前设备；选择云端保存后，问卷和报告会存入你的私密空间。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title section-title--first">信息处理</view>
  <view class="dl-list privacy-list">
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-index">01</view>
      <view class="dl-list-row__body">
        <view class="dl-list-row__title">保存的信息</view>
        <view class="dl-list-row__desc">包括问卷回答、回答时间、阶段核对记录、关系说明书和本人修正。评估本身不要求手机号。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-index">02</view>
      <view class="dl-list-row__body">
        <view class="dl-list-row__title">如何使用</view>
        <view class="dl-list-row__desc">仅用于生成、保存和维护你的个人关系说明书，不公开展示。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-index">03</view>
      <view class="dl-list-row__body">
        <view class="dl-list-row__title">如何删除</view>
        <view class="dl-list-row__desc">可以单独删除问卷和关系说明书；选择“删除全部资料”时，系统会同时删除云端和本机副本。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">后续参与与授权</view>
  <view class="dl-list privacy-list">
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">04</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">与报告相互独立</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">不提供联系方式也能获得完整报告。后续访谈联系、去标识化研究使用和线下活动邀请分别授权，默认均不勾选。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">05</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">联系方式隔离保存</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">参与资料、评估报告和联系方式分开保存。分析人员不能读取原始联系方式，访谈人员只能查看被分配案例所需的信息。</view></view></view>
    <view class="dl-list-row privacy-row"><view class="privacy-index">06</view><view class="dl-list-row__body"><view class="dl-list-row__title">随时撤回或删除</view><view class="dl-list-row__desc">撤回后不再进入新的联系名单；删除参与登记会删除授权、参与资料和联系方式，但不会删除问卷和关系说明书。</view></view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">上线前补充</view>
  <view class="privacy-callout">
    <view class="dl-list-row__title">补全运营信息</view>
    <view class="dl-list-row__desc">公开测试前必须补充运营主体、联系方式、保存期限和用户权利等完整隐私政策，并重新征得同意。</view>
  </view>
</view>
